<title>POLAND: WBK MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 13.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>WBK MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 13.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MARCH						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 13.46 vs   13.79</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   20.86 vs   20.46</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 41.06 vs   36.45</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	78.81 vs   67.42</p>
<p> JANUARY-MARCH				     1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 36.51 vs   38.61</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   56.64 vs   57.12</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		114.05 vs  104.75</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     222.06 vs  194.52</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Wielkopolski Bank</p>
<p>Kredytowy SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
